    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71668573\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\"><p>The government has approved a major overhaul of the Agnipath recruitment scheme, giving Agniveers who are not selected for regular service after their initial four-year tenure an additional two years of engagement, followed by an opportunity to join the Armed Forces as regular soldiers.</p><p>The decision, approved by the Cabinet on Wednesday (November 4, 2026) on the recommendations of the three services, creates a pathway for the eventual absorption of all willing Agniveers, subject to merit and prescribed selection criteria.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- November 05, 2026 09:38 am IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71668573\" data-title=\"What are the changes in Agniveer scheme, and what prompted government to implement them? | Explained\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/what-are-the-changes-in-agniveer-scheme-and-what-prompted-government-to-implement-them-explained/article71668573.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-4cdb60fd44a629562b537865-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/what-are-the-changes-in-agniveer-scheme-and-what-prompted-government-to-implement-them-explained/article71668573.ece');\">\n                Copy link  \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"email\"><a href=\"mailto:?subject=What%20are%20the%20changes%20in%20Agniveer%20scheme%2C%20and%20what%20prompted%20government%20to%20