    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71668416\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\"><p>Ravi Uppal, co-promoter of the multi-crore Mahadev online betting app, has been arrested in the UAE, and India is moving to extradite him, officials said on Wednesday (November 4, 2026).</p><p>The development follows the <a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/mahadev-betting-app-kingpin-sourabh-chandrakar-extradited-from-oman-to-india/article71653674.ece\" target=\"_self\">return from Oman</a> on November 1 of Mr. Uppal's friend and another Mahadev app promoter, Saurabh Chandrakar, after a court there allowed his extradition to India in a money-laundering case being probed by the Enforcement Directorate (ED).</p><p>Authorities in Dubai arrested a 46-year-old Uppal based on an Interpol Red Notice issued by Indian probe agencies, officials told <i>PTI</i>.</p><p>The Central Bureau of Investigation (CBI) and the ED are working to extradite him to India, they said.</p><p>Ravi Uppal was once detained by authorities in the UAE in 2023, but agencies later found that he was in Australia.</p><p>Probe agencies have claimed that Mr. Uppal obtained a passport from Vanuatu, an archipelagic country located in the South Pacific Ocean, just like Chandrakar.</p><p>It charged Mr. Uppal in October 2023, stating that he \"generated and enjoyed proceeds of crime and is involved in their concealment and layering\".</p><p>It alleged Ravi Uppal was \"looking after the delivery of the liaisoning money to the bureaucrats and politicians of Chhattisgarh through Chandrabhushan Verma, an assistant sub-inspector of police, and some others\".</p><p>Both Mr. Uppal and Mr. Chandrakar hail from Bhilai town in Durg district of Chhattisgarh.</p><p>A special court in Raipur on Wednesday (November 4, 2026) granted eight-day custody of Chandrakar to the CBI.</p><p>The agency said the Mahadev app, also called Mahadev Online Book (MOB), began operations in 2019-20. Its user base grew \"sharply\" during the COVID-19 pandemic in 2020 and continued to expand.</p><p>The app, which runs through thousands of panels, allegedly generated proceeds of crime worth ₹80,000 crore since 2019.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- November 05, 2026 07:01 am IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71668416\" data-title=\"Mahadev app co-promoter Ravi Uppal arrested in UAE, India moves for his extradition\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/mahadev-app-co-promoter-ravi-uppal-arrested-in-uae-india-moves-for-his-extradition/article71668416.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-c8f5f48f9e80d9e5dcd77723-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/mahadev-app-co-promoter-ravi-uppal-arrested-in-uae-india-moves-for-his-extradition/article71668416.ece');\">\n                Copy link  \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"email\"><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Mahadev%20app%20co-promoter%20Ravi%20Uppal%20arrested%20in%20UAE%2C%20India%20moves%20for%20his%20extradition&amp;amp;body=Check%20out%20this%20link%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thehindu.com%2Fnews%2Fnational%2Fmahadev-app-co-promoter-ravi-uppal-arrested-in-uae-india-moves-for-his-extradition%2Farticle71668416.ece\" target=\"_self\">\n                    Email     \n                                \n                </a></li><li class=\"facebook\" data-cf-modified-c8f5f48f9e80d9e5dcd77723-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; openShareLink('https://www.facebook.com/shar