    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71665888\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\"><p><i>Edited excerpts from a speech delivered by Professor Romila Thapar on ‘Historiography and Early Indian History’, during the second Sitaram Yechury Memorial Lecture</i></p><p>I would like to thank the Sitaram Yechury Foundation for the invitation to deliver a memorial lecture. The subject I have chosen to speak on is one on which I had a small conversation with Sitaram some time back, but we did not have the opportunity to discuss it at length. I am now speaking on it in remembrance.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- November 05, 2026 08:30 am IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71665888\" data-title=\"The purpose of history is not to construct statements for contemporary political use: Prof. Romila Thapar\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/the-purpose-of-history-is-not-to-construct-statements-for-contemporary-political-use-prof-romila-thapar/article71665888.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-b347fd6ea6491b363ccaa3be-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/the-purpose-of-history-is-not-to-construct-statements-for-contemporary-political-use-prof-romila-thapar/article71665888.ece');\">\n                Copy link  \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"email\"><a href=\"mailto:?subject=The%20purpose%20of%20history%20is%20not%20to%20construct%20statements%20for%20contemporary%20political%20use%3A%20Prof.%20R